<title>USA: Texarkana First Q2 March 31 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Texarkana First Q2 March 31 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>TEXARKANA, Ark. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.42		    $0.38</p>
<p> Net			    712			710</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,691		    1,850</p>
<p>	   6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.78		    $0.78</p>
<p> Net			  1,300		    1,437</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,707		    1,849</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said that in the third quarter of fiscal year 1996, it began repurchasing shares to be held as treasury stock and for employee benefit plans.  As of March 31, 1997, the company held 150,945 treasury shares and 62,935 for the employee benefit plans.</p>
